Learned SPP also highlighted the statements of accused persons and other witnesses namely Sh.
Sugma Sharma, Proprietor of M/s Karan Steel ; Sh. Suresh Kumar, Proprietor of M/s Surya Steel ;
Sh. Mahesh Prakash, the then Officer of Canara Bank and Sh. K.V. Prabhakar Rao, the then AGM of Canara Bank who had forwarded the proposal of the enhancement/sanction of CC Limit of the Company to the higher authorities in support of his case to show how the proceeds of the crime were generated and thereafter laundered by the accused Directorate of Enforcement vs. M/s Moskos Steel Pvt. Ltd Etc persons.
